   "text": "A scramble for dollar cash forces deleveraging through collateral and credit channels. The dollar rises as USDJPY falls, both spread tiers gap wider, equities and crude collapse, and even gold is sold; the VIX surge and lower 2-year yield confirm acute demand for liquidity.",
