   "text": "Decision memo. Regime: systemic deleveraging with an acute dollar premium. Equity and credit beta, commodity collateral, and unhedged dollar funding carry the greatest sensitivity; duration protection is uneven because the 2-year yield falls while the 10-year rises slightly. Gold's collapse alongside risky assets suggests cash raising, but leaves the usual haven signal ambiguous.",
